api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3253","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3253#pullrequestreview-4303593255"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3253"}},"submitted_at":"2026-05-16T11:37:27Z","updated_at":"2026-05-16T11:37:27Z","author_association":"OWNER","event":"reviewed"},{"id":25669844621,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz888AAAABBqV6M88AAAAF-gq-jQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/25669844621","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"58cfcace09fee022e7960fc5adb27a98a06ae6a8","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kradalby/headscale/commits/58cfcace09fee022e7960fc5adb27a98a06ae6a8","created_at":"2026-05-18T17:44:15Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"898f4a2d3eda7bb4a9f54c36e8527299672de3f5","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDg5OGY0YTJkM2VkYTdiYjRhOWY1NGMzNmU4NTI3Mjk5NjcyZGUzZjU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/898f4a2d3eda7bb4a9f54c36e8527299672de3f5","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/898f4a2d3eda7bb4a9f54c36e8527299672de3f5","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T18:26:01Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T18:26:01Z"},"tree":{"sha":"42a288f680dafcc663a5ae05af94fbe2f2f1cd99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/42a288f680dafcc663a5ae05af94fbe2f2f1cd99"},"message":".golangci: ignore tests for goconst, raise occurrence threshold\n\nTest fixtures repeat strings (IPs, tags, hostnames, user/email\nnames) by their nature; extracting each into a named constant\nadds indirection without adding clarity. Keep goconst strict on\nproduction code, off on tests.\n\n  ignore-tests: true       drop test-fixture noise entirely\n  min-occurrences: 5       raise from default 3 to filter\n                           \"happens thrice\" non-vocabulary cases\n  min-len: 6               skip short literals like \"set\", \"get\",\n                           \"new\" that read better at call sites","parents":[{"sha":"e2f2f9211f1bcf1ac59855edc26eeba2050302a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/e2f2f9211f1bcf1ac59855edc26eeba2050302a8","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/e2f2f9211f1bcf1ac59855edc26eeba2050302a8"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"c32f4c39b8f404f10fbfa56fe63fac81f518093c","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGMzMmY0YzM5YjhmNDA0ZjEwZmJmYTU2ZmU2M2ZhYzgxZjUxODA5M2M","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/c32f4c39b8f404f10fbfa56fe63fac81f518093c","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/c32f4c39b8f404f10fbfa56fe63fac81f518093c","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T18:32:58Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T18:32:58Z"},"tree":{"sha":"8899d22a28fdeccab62578238d0a72f4df16458b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/8899d22a28fdeccab62578238d0a72f4df16458b"},"message":"metrics, policy/v2: drop unused scaffolding + nil-error returns\n\nTwo cleanups in the same package boundary:\n\npolicy/v2.Policy.compileFilterRules and compileFilterRulesForNode\nreturned (rules, error) where the error was always nil. Drop the\nerror return and the dead error handling at 15 call sites in the\ncompat tests.\n\nDelete code with no callers:\n  hscontrol/metrics.go\n    prometheusMiddleware + respWriterProm — custom HTTP timer\n    middleware that was never registered. /metrics stays mounted\n    via debug.go and noise.go; mapresponse_* counters keep emitting.\n    httpDuration and httpCounter — backing metrics for the deleted\n    middleware.\n  hscontrol/policy/v2/filter.go\n    resolvedAddrsToPrincipals — superseded by ipSetToPrincipals.\n    ipSetToPrefixStringList — superseded by inline prefix\n    formatting at the surviving callers.\n  hscontrol/policy/v2/tailscale_{acl,grants}_data_compat_test.go\n    setupACLCompatNodes / setupGrantsCompatNodes — the data-driven\n    tests switched to per-scenario topology reconstruction.","parents":[{"sha":"898f4a2d3eda7bb4a9f54c36e8527299672de3f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/898f4a2d3eda7bb4a9f54c36e8527299672de3f5","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/898f4a2d3eda7bb4a9f54c36e8527299672de3f5"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"240ad47740d6da7e8cde7e3e0ca0c84d417aef26","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDI0MGFkNDc3NDBkNmRhN2U4Y2RlN2UzZTBjYTBjODRkNDE3YWVmMjY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/240ad47740d6da7e8cde7e3e0ca0c84d417aef26","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/240ad47740d6da7e8cde7e3e0ca0c84d417aef26","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T18:33:40Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T18:33:40Z"},"tree":{"sha":"655d8b67b8a2249af83ecce2727a7c1e25771cac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/655d8b67b8a2249af83ecce2727a7c1e25771cac"},"message":"cmd, templates, integration: extract shared production constants\n\nConstants the operator/test reader benefits from centralising.\nTests stay verbatim (the .golangci.yaml goconst tune skips them);\nextraction here applies only where the same literal acts as\nshared vocabulary across files.\n\n  cmd/headscale/cli/strings.go (new)\n    Cobra subcommand verbs and aliases shared by every list / show\n    / new / delete / expire command across api_key, nodes, policy,\n    preauthkeys, users — plus the Result / Created / Expiration\n    column headers used in printOutput maps.\n\n  hscontrol/templates/design.go\n    cssBorderHS, cssBreakWord, cssCenter, cssOverflowWrap — shared\n    styles applied across design.go, ping.go, register_confirm.go.\n    spaceS already existed; switch raw \"0.5rem\" literals to it.\n\n  integration/hsic/hsic.go\n    binHeadscale, flagOutput, acceptJSON — names invoked across\n    hsic.go and config.go.\n\n  integration/tsic/tsic.go\n    tailscaleBin — used across docker exec call sites.","parents":[{"sha":"c32f4c39b8f404f10fbfa56fe63fac81f518093c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/c32f4c39b8f404f10fbfa56fe63fac81f518093c","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/c32f4c39b8f404f10fbfa56fe63fac81f518093c"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"945ea0bc92da4798356658c2b62fd5c4358f3128","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDk0NWVhMGJjOTJkYTQ3OTgzNTY2NThjMmI2MmZkNWM0MzU4ZjMxMjg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/945ea0bc92da4798356658c2b62fd5c4358f3128","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/945ea0bc92da4798356658c2b62fd5c4358f3128","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T18:34:27Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T18:34:27Z"},"tree":{"sha":"c2c10f2854a008ae3882cb6653c3bfe4cea6be87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/c2c10f2854a008ae3882cb6653c3bfe4cea6be87"},"message":"all: mechanical lint fixes\n\n  hscontrol/debug.go — pre-size nodes []nodeStatus to len(debugInfo)\n    so the loop does not grow under append.\n  hscontrol/mapper/batcher_test.go — testing.TB parameter on\n    setupBatcherWithTestData renamed t → tb so thelper sees the\n    expected name.\n  hscontrol/db/text_serialiser.go — reflect.Ptr → reflect.Pointer\n    (deprecated alias).","parents":[{"sha":"240ad47740d6da7e8cde7e3e0ca0c84d417aef26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/240ad47740d6da7e8cde7e3e0ca0c84d417aef26","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/240ad47740d6da7e8cde7e3e0ca0c84d417aef26"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"aeff1b9171bcd5703c714c285931e3fdab766f58","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGFlZmYxYjkxNzFiY2Q1NzAzYzcxNGMyODU5MzFlM2ZkYWI3NjZmNTg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/aeff1b9171bcd5703c714c285931e3fdab766f58","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/aeff1b9171bcd5703c714c285931e3fdab766f58","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T18:34:58Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T18:34:58Z"},"tree":{"sha":"62b2e753ea24ce8d170726764e9f3116bcd5feb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/62b2e753ea24ce8d170726764e9f3116bcd5feb2"},"message":"all: annotate gosec false positives with rationale\n\nEach //nolint:gosec carries the gosec code and one line on why\nthe finding is a false positive or already mitigated.\n\n  G124 cookies (oidc.go x3, oidc_confirm_test.go)\n    Secure is set conditionally on req.TLS != nil; HttpOnly and\n    SameSiteStrictMode already on. gosec misses the conditional.\n    Test fixture cookie is explicitly a test fixture.\n\n  G705 (debug.go)\n    templates.PingPage(...).Render() is a templ component that\n    auto-escapes user input.\n\n  G706 (scenario.go)\n    Integration log emits trusted scenario state. The pre-built\n    image G706 sites in hsic.go / tsic.go ride along with the\n    earlier constants commit.\n\n  G710 (app.go, tailsql.go)\n    Redirect target is \"trusted ServerURL prefix + path\". gosec\n    cannot see past the prefix.","parents":[{"sha":"945ea0bc92da4798356658c2b62fd5c4358f3128","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/945ea0bc92da4798356658c2b62fd5c4358f3128","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/945ea0bc92da4798356658c2b62fd5c4358f3128"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"b584d882edae6ab85e3b0b74e486a9cafd239587","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGI1ODRkODgyZWRhZTZhYjg1ZTNiMGI3NGU0ODZhOWNhZmQyMzk1ODc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/b584d882edae6ab85e3b0b74e486a9cafd239587","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/b584d882edae6ab85e3b0b74e486a9cafd239587","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T18:35:23Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T18:35:23Z"},"tree":{"sha":"430eab9e1e5967c7abafda507ce853f868da0516","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/430eab9e1e5967c7abafda507ce853f868da0516"},"message":"all: annotate complex functions with gocyclo rationale\n\nSplitting these functions does not buy clarity — each has been\nextracted before and put back. Pin the //nolint:gocyclo on each\nwith the reason their shape resists clean decomposition.\n\n  policy/v2/policy.go     ViaRoutesForPeer        — three-pass\n                                                    via-grant resolution\n  policy/v2/filter.go     compileSSHPolicy        — per-rule\n                                                    branches with\n                                                    intertwined\n                                                    autogroup:self\n                                                    handling\n                                                    (annotated in the\n                                                    earlier nil-error\n                                                    commit)\n  state/state.go          HandleNodeFromPreAuthKey — security-\n                                                    sensitive\n                                                    sequential\n                                                    validation order\n  servertest/routes_test  TestRoutes              — table-driven\n                                                    test driver with\n                                                    many independent\n                                                    subtests\n\nAlso: //nolint:recvcheck on policy/v2.SSHUser — UnmarshalJSON\nrequires a pointer receiver; the other methods on this string\nnewtype use value receivers by convention.","parents":[{"sha":"aeff1b9171bcd5703c714c285931e3fdab766f58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/aeff1b9171bcd5703c714c285931e3fdab766f58","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/aeff1b9171bcd5703c714c285931e3fdab766f58"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"6dc755cf20692221969dc109badc1643426b1ac7","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDZkYzc1NWNmMjA2OTIyMjE5NjlkYzEwOWJhZGMxNjQzNDI2YjFhYzc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/6dc755cf20692221969dc109badc1643426b1ac7","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/6dc755cf20692221969dc109badc1643426b1ac7","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T18:35:53Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T18:35:53Z"},"tree":{"sha":"dc92b911da6d33eff0f98b5d39077c4e3718f9a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/dc92b911da6d33eff0f98b5d39077c4e3718f9a5"},"message":"all: apply godoc [Name] link conventions across comments\n\nEvery Go-identifier reference in // and /* */ comments now uses\ngodoc's [Name] linking syntax so pkg.go.dev and `go doc` render\nthem as clickable cross-references. No behaviour change.\n\nPattern applied across the tree:\n  In-package         [Foo], [Foo.Bar]\n  Cross-package      [pkg.Foo], [pkg.Foo.Bar]\n  Stdlib             [netip.Prefix], [errors.Is], [context.Context]\n  Tailscale          [tailcfg.MapResponse], [tailcfg.Node.CapMap],\n                     [tailcfg.NodeAttrSuggestExitNode]\n\nSkip rules:\n  - File:line refs left as plain text\n  - HuJSON wire keys inside backtick raw strings untouched\n  - ACL/policy syntax tokens (tag:foo, autogroup:self, ...) not Go\n    symbols, left as plain text\n  - JSON/OIDC wire keys, gorm tags, RFC IPv6 placeholders, markdown\n    link tags, decorative dividers — all left as-is","parents":[{"sha":"b584d882edae6ab85e3b0b74e486a9cafd239587","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/b584d882edae6ab85e3b0b74e486a9cafd239587","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/b584d882edae6ab85e3b0b74e486a9cafd239587"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":25672103387,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz888AAAABBqV6M88AAAAF-i